      "content": "wait so 14.4 units total? okay i think i get it now. but i'm also feeling a bit lightheaded and shaky right now, like maybe my blood sugar dropped a little before i ate the pasta? if i take that 14.4 units on top of what i'm feeling, am i gonna crash? just tell me if it's safe to go ahead with the 14.4 now or if i should wait a bit. i really need a straight answer so i know what to do.",
